OL,3,ACall of Duty promises a return to form
OL,4,A- but can it compete with GTA?
OL,5,
OL,6,FCall of Duty is back - and it's got a
OL,7,Flot to prove.
OL,9,FLast year was a low point for the video
OL,10,Fgame juggernaut, with poor reviews for
OL,11,Fits single-player campaign mode and
OL,12,Fmultiplayer fans defecting to rival
OL,13,Ftitles.
OL,15,FSo for latest instalment, Modern
OL,16,FWarfare 4, publisher Activision is
OL,17,Fpulling out all the stops to bring fans
OL,18,Fback on board.
